p.src:
If $V=0$, this reduces to $\boxed{
\frac{1}{c^2}\phi_{tt}-\nabla^2\phi=0
},$ the wave equation. The lecture recognizes the equation but postpones solving it. Its solutions propagate disturbances at speed $c$.

